{"4858900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MAMIO : Don't Fall !", "steam_appid": 4858900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>One player fails. Everyone pays ! </strong></i><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858900/extras/b0784af08a222f764cb377230612a091.poster.avif?t=1786916320\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858900/extras/b0784af08a222f764cb377230612a091.webm?t=1786916320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858900/extras/b0784af08a222f764cb377230612a091.mp4?t=1786916320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>MAMIO : DON'T FALL : </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MAMIO is a 2–4 player online co-op platformer where teamwork is everything. Jump, fart, stumble, and survive your way through dangerous obstacle courses... because if one player falls, everyone goes back to the first checkpoint.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES : </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>👥 2–4 Player Co-op Chaos:</strong> Team up with friends to navigate treacherous platforms where every jump matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🧩 Mind-Bending Puzzles:</strong> Work together to solve intricate environmental puzzles that test your coordination and communication.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚠️ High-Stakes Consequences:</strong> One slip-up sends the whole team back to the start , rely on your squad to survive the fall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🗺️ Dynamic Levels:</strong> Conquer multiple distinct environments, each increasing in difficulty and platforming complexity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎙️ Proximity Voice Chat:</strong> Coordinate your moves in real time with total immersion; if they can hear you, you’re close enough to help.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🕺 Express Yourself:</strong> Use a variety of emotes and custom dance moves to celebrate your narrow escapes or laugh off a group wipe.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔥 Endless Fun:</strong> Designed for fast-paced sessions where teamwork is the only way to avoid the drop and claim victory.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONE PLAYER'S MISTAKE RESETS THE ENTIRE TEAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success depends on everyone. <strong>If a one player falls, the whole team is sent back to the beginning of the level.</strong> Every jump matters, and every mistake is shared.<br>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858900/extras/553ef0e1c0fdcd3db8a8cb9fae6de5e6.poster.avif?t=1786916320\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858900/extras/553ef0e1c0fdcd3db8a8cb9fae6de5e6.webm?t=1786916320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858900/extras/553ef0e1c0fdcd3db8a8cb9fae6de5e6.mp4?t=1786916320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FART POWERED MOVEMENT : </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>fart orbs</strong> to refill your <strong>double jump</strong> and keep your team moving through every challenge.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858900/extras/aff07c536a36ab027d8b15b2e776463a.poster.avif?t=1786916320\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858900/extras/aff07c536a36ab027d8b15b2e776463a.webm?t=1786916320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858900/extras/aff07c536a36ab027d8b15b2e776463a.mp4?t=1786916320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILT FOR TEAMWORK :</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAMIO</strong> is designed for 2–4 players. Cooperation isn't optional, many challenges require teammates working together, communicating, and helping each other reach the finish line.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858900/extras/9d6fbe7343f3acd4d453ba555906984f.poster.avif?t=1786916320\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858900/extras/9d6fbe7343f3acd4d453ba555906984f.webm?t=1786916320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858900/extras/9d6fbe7343f3acd4d453ba555906984f.mp4?t=1786916320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FRIENDLY FIRE :</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the biggest threat isn’t the level, it’s your teammates. <strong>Give them a kick and watch the chaos unfold</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858900/extras/08ab4821a4ae647416bf03a912fb7fe9.poster.avif?t=1786916320\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858900/extras/08ab4821a4ae647416bf03a912fb7fe9.webm?t=1786916320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858900/extras/08ab4821a4ae647416bf03a912fb7fe9.mp4?t=1786916320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNIQUE WORLDS:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore carefully crafted worlds filled with moving platforms &amp; deadly traps. Every level introduces new mechanics to keep the adventure fresh. The path ahead is anything but safe. Stay on your feet, adapt to the unexpected, and try not to get sent flying.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858900/extras/7d8ae16d7f53a762aaffd6ae67449964.poster.avif?t=1786916320\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858900/extras/7d8ae16d7f53a762aaffd6ae67449964.webm?t=1786916320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858900/extras/7d8ae16d7f53a762aaffd6ae67449964.mp4?t=1786916320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>One player fails. Everyone pays ! </strong></i><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858900/extras/b0784af08a222f764cb377230612a091.poster.avif?t=1786916320\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858900/extras/b0784af08a222f764cb377230612a091.webm?t=1786916320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858900/extras/b0784af08a222f764cb377230612a091.mp4?t=1786916320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>MAMIO : DON'T FALL : </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MAMIO is a 2–4 player online co-op platformer where teamwork is everything. Jump, fart, stumble, and survive your way through dangerous obstacle courses... because if one player falls, everyone goes back to the first checkpoint.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES : </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>👥 2–4 Player Co-op Chaos:</strong> Team up with friends to navigate treacherous platforms where every jump matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🧩 Mind-Bending Puzzles:</strong> Work together to solve intricate environmental puzzles that test your coordination and communication.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚠️ High-Stakes Consequences:</strong> One slip-up sends the whole team back to the start , rely on your squad to survive the fall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🗺️ Dynamic Levels:</strong> Conquer multiple distinct environments, each increasing in difficulty and platforming complexity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎙️ Proximity Voice Chat:</strong> Coordinate your moves in real time with total immersion; if they can hear you, you’re close enough to help.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🕺 Express Yourself:</strong> Use a variety of emotes and custom dance moves to celebrate your narrow escapes or laugh off a group wipe.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔥 Endless Fun:</strong> Designed for fast-paced sessions where teamwork is the only way to avoid the drop and claim victory.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONE PLAYER'S MISTAKE RESETS THE ENTIRE TEAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success depends on everyone. <strong>If a one player falls, the whole team is sent back to the beginning of the level.</strong> Every jump matters, and every mistake is shared.<br>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858900/extras/553ef0e1c0fdcd3db8a8cb9fae6de5e6.poster.avif?t=1786916320\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858900/extras/553ef0e1c0fdcd3db8a8cb9fae6de5e6.webm?t=1786916320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858900/extras/553ef0e1c0fdcd3db8a8cb9fae6de5e6.mp4?t=1786916320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FART POWERED MOVEMENT : </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>fart orbs</strong> to refill your <strong>double jump</strong> and keep your team moving through every challenge.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858900/extras/aff07c536a36ab027d8b15b2e776463a.poster.avif?t=1786916320\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858900/extras/aff07c536a36ab027d8b15b2e776463a.webm?t=1786916320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858900/extras/aff07c536a36ab027d8b15b2e776463a.mp4?t=1786916320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILT FOR TEAMWORK :</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAMIO</strong> is designed for 2–4 players. Cooperation isn't optional, many challenges require teammates working together, communicating, and helping each other reach the finish line.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4858900/extras/9d6fbe7343f3acd4d453ba555906984f.poster.avif?t=1786916320\" width=800 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass